  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&apos;s Grassroots Football Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the education of coaches and development of grassroots football, the overarching ambition of the project is to stimulate reconciliation and peaceful coexistence between different populaces in Iraq. Additionally, the project aims to create greater acceptance in Iraq, of girls wishing to play football.</narrative>
  </description>
